{"id": "99210018", "name": "פונקציית הסתברות C·q^k על הטבעיים – מציאת C והסתברות לבחירת מספר זוגי", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>בוחרים מספר טבעי, כלומר מרחב המדגם הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\Omega=\\{1,2,3,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>, ונתון ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}(\\{k\\})=C\\cdot\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)^k\\)</span> לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>.</p><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">א. מצאו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(C\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ב. מה ההסתברות שנבחר מספר זוגי?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> סכום ההסתברויות הוא 1 (טור הנדסי); המאורע \"זוגי\" הוא איחוד זר של המאורעות \\(\\{2n\\}\\).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הקבוע C</b><br>המאורעות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\{1\\},\\{2\\},\\ldots\\)</span> זרים, והאיחוד שלהם הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span>. לכן, לפי סכום של טור הנדסי עם איבר ראשון <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(C\\cdot{{CT:0}}\\)</span> ומנה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ 1=\\sum_{k=1}^\\infty C\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)^k=\\frac{C\\cdot{{CT:0}}}{1-{{CT:0}}}\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad C={{CT:1}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — מספר זוגי</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}(\\{2,4,6,\\ldots\\})=\\sum_{n=1}^\\infty C\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)^{2n}=C\\cdot\\frac{\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)^2}{1-\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)^2}={{CT:2}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "cc", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "pe", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["cc", "pe", "qq"], "nvariants": 7}